  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"用于查询IOS应用列表。适用于开放平台中该能力的查询、配置或管理场景。\",\"id\":\"ad.ios_app.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/ios_app/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1866322298595340\",\"related_docs\":[],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1866322298595340\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"查询IOS应用列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-dzs498ovkww00\">最新查询IOS应用列表</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1862324809491467%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22txFur%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-iouu8y5tzog00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-iouu8y5tzog00\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-6jqnjmoiwnc00\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/ios_app/list/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1866322298595340\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-ga8jmu2vg2o00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-ga8jmu2vg2o00\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ezyv5jvlq9400\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-210vhdszvc800\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-210vhdszvc800\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-hag3z0gmxwg00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-hag3z0gmxwg00\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-33k7u6tjfva000\">账户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户类型 EBP/AD 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-ftwq574w9uw00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-iooscio86b400\"><code>AD</code>：营销账户，查询账户下可用于巨量营销投放的应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-8yoogz9is8c00\"><code>EBP</code>：升级版巨量引擎工作台，查询组织下管理和被共享的应用</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">search_key</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-cvjkjdwvx1k00\">搜索关键字 itunes_id或者应用名称</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3ur2xyhjgqw000\">可以为空，可以传中文/英文，长度不超过50</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">应用审核状态，不传默认查询全部状态，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-40dmuc9viwu000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1zs5r5pysyio00\"><code>REVIEWING</code> 审核中</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1xppcj74d21s00\"><code>REVIEW_FAIL</code> 审核失败</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2hk0v767914000\"><code>REVIEW_SUCCESS</code> 审核成功</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">search_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">应用范围，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2e46n61fp30g00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-40ba2n9b3oc000\"><code>ALL</code> 查询全部，包括创建和被共享的应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-48625rnjps6000\"><code>CREATE_ONLY</code> 只查询创建的应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2bjvhp4ou05c00\"><code>SHARED_ONLY</code> 只查询被共享的应用</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_asset_query_scope</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">应用归属来源，不传默认全部，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-56qdtmf6c7w000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-deu2wud0law00\"><code>ACCOUNT_ONLY</code> 仅查询来源营销账户创建的应用（即在巨量营销平台应用管理中心上传的iOS应用）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-s42v9i72tvk00\"><code>ALL</code> 所有来源，即包含巨量营销平台和升级版工作台上传的iOS应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-57uvn8d99zk000\"><code>DIRECT_EBP_ONLY</code> 仅查询账户直属升级版工作台团队的iOS应用</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">hierarchy</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">EBP 查询层级<p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-gsf1rwkp4kg00\">若入参账户类型为营销账户，则不传默认查adv直属升级版组织id的应用</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5mjoiuauays00\">若入参账户类型为升级版组织，则不传默认查当前组织及下属组织的所有应用</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-8di5zjk76k000\">可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-dyfrt1tw10o00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3emhdy1ngqg000\"><code>DIRECT</code> 查询当前组织创建或被共享的应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-31eybub3bj0000\"><code>TRAVERSE</code> 查询当前组织及下属组织创建或被共享的应用</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1icazjk5h8qo0\"></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">publish_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2bx3p9kirujo00\">应用发布时间</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">查询起始日期，格式为秒时间戳</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">发布结束时间，格式为秒时间戳</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_generation</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">资产版本，智擎版仅可使用升级版资产，非智擎版项目搭建两种资产版本均可使用，不传默认筛选全部，允许值:  <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1rbi1y50vg6800\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3wlptvp9ljm000\"><code>LEGACY</code> 旧版资产</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1gjy99cqa2n400\"><code>OC_USABLE</code> 升级版资产</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-34flstjalm8000\">不传默认为1，最小为1</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-393w2orx6ro000\">不穿默认为10，最小为1，最大为100</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-ejxhw89944000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-ejxhw89944000\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fios_app%2Flist%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_id%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20page%20%3D%20PAGE%5Cn%20%20%20%20size%20%3D%20SIZE%5Cn%20%20%20%20search_key%20%3D%20SEARCH_KEY%5Cn%20%20%20%20status%20%3D%20STATUS%5Cn